flowchart TD
    IN[User Input] --> DET[Uncertainty Detector]
    DET -->|Uncertain| PAUSE[Pause & Request Human Approval]
    PAUSE --> HUMAN[Human Approver]
    HUMAN --> RESUME[Resume with Validated Context]
    DET -->|Confident| ACT[Proceed with Action]
    RESUME --> AUDIT[Audit Trail]
    ACT --> AUDIT
